Z||000002||KRMFiero||08-16-2001||12:46 AM||||Do a search,<BR>The S-10 2.8 is RWD so you will have to drill new holes for engine mounts and stuff, u would want to swap the old heads/intake from fiero onto it. the blocks are basically the same except for some few minor things... do a search<P>Kyle||||reg||1
